    "en": {
      "name": "The Sun God's Poet - Helpoemer",
      "effect": "You can discard 1 other card; Special Summon this card from your hand. If this card is Special Summoned: You can add 1 \"Sun God\" card from your Deck to your hand, except \"The Sun God's Poet - Helpoemer\", then if your opponent's LP are at least 2000 higher than yours, you can discard 1 random card from their hand. During the End Phase, if \"The Immortal Sun God\" was sent to your GY this turn: You can add this card from your GY to your hand. You can only use each effect of \"The Sun God's Poet - Helpoemer\" once per turn.",
